From 763324af069faa9c29048f07e12500d8d730d3fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Son Trinh <son.trinh.fz@renesas.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 15:31:11 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] vsp2driver: Refactor subdev pad ops to v4l2_subdev_state

Refactor sub-device pad operations to use the subdev state-based API.

All pad operations now operate on struct v4l2_subdev_state instead of
v4l2_subdev_pad_config. Format and selection handling is routed through
the state helpers.

Signed-off-by: Son Trinh <son.trinh.fz@renesas.com>
---
 vsp2driver/vsp2_brs.c    | 112 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 vsp2driver/vsp2_bru.c    | 108 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 vsp2driver/vsp2_clu.c    |  45 ++++++++++++-
 vsp2driver/vsp2_entity.c | 129 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 vsp2driver/vsp2_entity.h |  38 ++++++++++-
 vsp2driver/vsp2_hgo.c    |   4 ++
